              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Otaryangira mwene waanyu aha mutima, kureka oshemereire kuhana mutaahi waawe, otakaagiibwaho orubanja ahabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
