              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mugire eminzaani ehikire, amabaare gahikire, eefa ehikire na hiini ehikire. Niinye MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
